menu "GPIO: General Purpose Input/Output"

# ==================================
# GPIO
# ==================================
config MR_USE_DRIVER_GPIO
    depends on MR_USE_DRIVER
    bool "Use GPIO"
    default n
    help
        Enable GPIO driver for general purpose digital I/O pins.
        Features:
            - Configurable input/output modes
            - Pull-up/pull-down resistor control
            - Triggered interrupt support (rising/falling/both/high/low)
            - Port-based batch operations for efficiency
        Fundamental for controlling LEDs, buttons, switches, and chip selects.
        HardTree backends also support PCF8574/PCF8574A and PCA9555 over I2C,
        and MCP23017/MCP23S17 over I2C/SPI when that bus driver is enabled.

endmenu
